{
  "version": "1.2",
  "description": "Authoritative token contract for css-is-awesome themes. Every theme.css MUST declare every token in `required`. Tokens in `optional` are reported by the validator as info, never as failures \u2014 the library or the theme generator supplies a default. Source of truth is CONTRACT.md (human-readable) and public/theme.css (Sketchbook reference). Contract 1.1 (2026-09-18): --space-unit relaxed from required to optional; it had been added as required in library 1.12.0, which VERSIONING.md forbids in a MINOR. Contract 1.2 (2026-09-18): `features` groups every optional token by the capability it enables, so a validator or installer can say \"missing the tokens for print\" instead of listing all optional tokens.",
  "required": [
    "--action-primary-active",
    "--action-primary-default",
    "--action-primary-hover",
    "--action-primary-wash",
    "--action-secondary-active",
    "--action-secondary-default",
    "--action-secondary-hover",
    "--action-secondary-wash",
    "--action-tertiary-active",
    "--action-tertiary-default",
    "--action-tertiary-hover",
